      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "It can seems like a strange request to introduce this flag but:\r\n\r\n* We want to rather prevent deposits or transfers into role based accounts if we lack currency symbol.\r\n\r\n* I don't think that this check should not be concern of the validator level checks.\r\n\r\n* This check should prevent possible money locking in the future.",
